<tab><cl=F0F010>CHARACTER CREATION<cl=A2A2A2><br><br>
<tab>By clicking on the arrows next to the items <cl=FFFFFF>Face<cl=B0B0B0>, <cl=FFFFFF>Hairstyle<cl=B0B0B0>, <cl=FFFFFF>Hair<cl=B0B0B0>, <cl=FFFFFF>Tattoo<cl=B0B0B0>, select the appearance of your character. To change the gender to female, click on the "Male" label (the default gender of the character). The selected character name cannot exceed 15 characters.<br>
